@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_DE_ACCESO

### PAYMENTS - solicitudes HTTP
# Reemplaza el token y ajusta los cuerpos JSON al modelo de la entidad.

### GET /payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET /payments/1
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST /payments
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referenceType": "SALE",
  "referenceId": 1,
  "method": "CASH",
  "amount": "650000.00",
  "date": "2026-10-14T10:00:00.000Z",
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

###

